  sequenceLabelId: A5
  narrativeCategory: 2
  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: "Ren\xE9e Gl\xFCck\nMay God remember\nthe soul of the woman\nRachel,
      daughter of Elka,\nRen\xE9e Gl\xFCck,\nwho was killed in sanctification of
      the Name\nin the year 705 (1945) by the\nNazi murderers in the Belsen camp.\nHe
      who avenges blood has remembered her!\n'May her soul be bound in the bundle
      of life'\nBorn in Hlohovec CSR November 26, 1910."
